= Courses
Course information, lecture slides and textbooks

Each course is a site of its own, with the course information, the slides, the textbook and any
other files on one page. Material files are **not** stored in this repository: they live in a
separate GitHub repository and are linked from the course page, so this site stays small and the
files can be updated on their own.

~~~
{}{raw}
<ul class="cards">
  <li>
    <p class="card-title"><a href="ee301.html">Wireless Communications (EE301)</a></p>
    <p class="card-meta">Undergraduate &middot; Spring 2026 &middot; 3 credits</p>
    <p class="card-meta">How a wireless link works, from path loss and fading to the capacity
      of a multi-user system.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p class="card-title"><a href="ee502.html">Convex Optimization for Engineers (EE502)</a></p>
    <p class="card-meta">Graduate &middot; Autumn 2025 &middot; 3 credits</p>
    <p class="card-meta">Convex sets and functions, duality, and how to recognise and solve the
      optimization problems that appear in communications.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p class="card-title"><a href="research-methods.html">Research Methods Seminar</a></p>
    <p class="card-meta">Master and PhD &middot; Every semester &middot; 1 credit</p>
    <p class="card-meta">Reading a paper critically, writing a technical report, giving a talk,
      and using Git and LaTeX for your thesis.</p>
  </li>
</ul>
~~~

== Supervision

I supervise *prethesis*, *thesis* and *internship* projects, and a weekly seminar runs for the
group. See [joining.html Prethesis and Thesis] for the topics on offer and how to get in touch.

