# TEMPLATE -- to add a course:
#   1. create www/<course>.jemdoc using ee301.jemdoc as the pattern;
#   2. add its line to www/menu-courses.jemdoc;
#   3. add a card below;
#   4. add the course to www/menu.jemdoc if it should appear on the main site too.
#
# A card is one <li> block. Keep class="cards" on the <ul> and the
# card-title / card-meta classes on the paragraphs -- the stylesheet needs them.
#
#   <li>
#     <p class="card-title"><a href="newcourse.html">Course title (CODE)</a></p>
#     <p class="card-meta">Level &middot; Semester &middot; N credits</p>
#     <p class="card-meta">One sentence on what the course covers.</p>
#   </li>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
